-docsbarcelona-docsbarcelona-2026-05-10-1800-i-am-belfast-20","name":"I Am Belfast","coordinates":[41.3784,2.1713],"description":"Part of the Mark Cousins Docs d Honor retrospective, a poetic portrait of Belfast, its people, architecture, landscape, and conflict memory. When: Sun, May 10, 6:00 PM. Venue: Filmoteca | Sala Chomon.","bookingUrl":"https://docsbarcelona.com/en/festival/calendar/","photo":"https://docsbarcelona.com/wp-content/uploads/ef977e91-938b-4532-9796-061829391c78-1-scaled.jpg","eventTime":"Sun, May 10, 6:00 PM","eventVenue":"Filmoteca | Sala Chomon","itineraryDate":"2026-05-10","itineraryDay":4},{"id":"barcelona-2026-05-docsbarcelona-docsbarcelona-2026-05-10-1800-la-pieta-21","name":"La Pieta","coordinates":[41.3803,2.1609],"description":"A glacier requiem linking family isolation, Icelandic landscape, photography, and ecological loss. When: Sun, May 10, 6:00 PM. Venue: Renoir | Sala 6.","bookingUrl":"https://docsbarcelona.com/en/festival/calendar/","photo":"https://docsbarcelona.com/wp-content/uploads/e8442c5e-38c7-4b97-a9c5-190bdf16649b-1-scaled.jpg","eventTime":"Sun, May 10, 6:00 PM","eventVenue":"Renoir | Sala 6","itineraryDate":"2026-05-10","itineraryDay":4},{"id":"barcelona-2026-05-docsbarcelona-docsbarcelona-2026-05-10-1830-accio-portabella-22","name":"Accio Portabella","coordinates":[41.3717,2.1589],"description":"Official calendar screening in the DocsBarcelona program. When: Sun, May 10, 6:30 PM. Venue: Casa Montjuic.","bookingUrl":"https://docsbarcelona.com/en/festival/calendar/","eventTime":"Sun, May 10, 6:30 PM","eventVenue":"Casa Montjuic","itineraryDate":"2026-05-10","itineraryDay":4},{"id":"barcelona-2026-05-docsbarcelona-docsbarcelona-2026-05-10-1900-with-hasan-in-gaza-23","name":"With Hasan in Gaza","coordinates":[41.3756,2.1446],"description":"Kamal Aljafari uses recovered 2001 video tapes to turn a search in Gaza into a reflection on memory, loss, place, and time. When: Sun, May 10, 7:00 PM. Venue: Zumzeig.","bookingUrl":"https: