2.1703],"description":"Victor Kossakovsky offers a wordless cinematic interpretation of Sisyphus, continuing the empathy trilogy begun with Gunda. When: Fri, May 15, 7:30 PM. Venue: Phenomena.","bookingUrl":"https://docsbarcelona.com/en/festival/calendar/","photo":"https://docsbarcelona.com/wp-content/uploads/0428bd1c-2c3f-4c77-b2b1-3902c23e9327-1-scaled.jpg","eventTime":"Fri, May 15, 7:30 PM","eventVenue":"Phenomena","itineraryDate":"2026-05-15","itineraryDay":9},{"id":"barcelona-2026-05-docsbarcelona-docsbarcelona-2026-05-15-2045-curtmetratges-somni-i-veritat-64","name":"Curtmetratges: Somni i veritat","coordinates":[41.383,2.1662],"description":"A short-film program from the official DocsBarcelona calendar around dream and truth. When: Fri, May 15, 8:45 PM. Venue: CCCB Auditori.","bookingUrl":"https://docsbarcelona.com/en/festival/calendar/","photo":"https://docsbarcelona.com/wp-content/uploads/8ada51d7-003a-4a61-b9e7-3d6f0fa4a88a-1.jpg","eventTime":"Fri, May 15, 8:45 PM","eventVenue":"CCCB Auditori","itineraryDate":"2026-05-15","itineraryDay":9},{"id":"barcelona-2026-05-docsbarcelona-docsbarcelona-2026-05-15-2045-plato-3-65","name":"Plato 3","coordinates":[41.4024,2.1586],"description":"Maria Borrell returns to a closed rural Lleida pub through young people rehearsing a play about nights that still carry old shadows. When: Fri, May 15, 8:45 PM. Venue: Cinemes Texas | Sala 1.","bookingUrl":"https://docsbarcelona.com/en/festival/calendar/","photo":"https://docsbarcelona.com/wp-content/uploads/f0c5cc4f-cb6d-458d-a5f6-6ad0796459e1-1.png","eventTime":"Fri, May 15, 8:45 PM","eventVenue":"Cinemes Texas | Sala 1","itineraryDate":"2026-05-15","itineraryDay":9},{"id":"barcelona-2026-05-docsbarcelona-docsbarcelona-2026-05-15-2045-the-beauty-of-errors-66","name":"The Beauty Of Errors","coordinates":[41.3803,2.1609],"description":"A father-and-son portrait about intimacy, separation, loneliness, and the fear of losing love. When: Fri, May 15, 8:45 PM. Venue: Renoir | Sala 6.