-award-winner-screening-76","title":"Audience award winner screening","venue":"CCCB Teatre","startsAt":"2026-05-17T18:00:00+02:00","description":"Sunday winner-screening slot from the official calendar for the festival audience award.","coordinates":[41.383,2.1662],"url":"https://docsbarcelona.com/en/festival/calendar/"},{"id":"docsbarcelona-2026-05-17-2000-best-film-winner-screening-77","title":"Best film winner screening","venue":"CCCB Teatre","startsAt":"2026-05-17T20:00:00+02:00","description":"Sunday winner-screening slot from the official calendar for the best film winner.","coordinates":[41.383,2.1662],"url":"https://docsbarcelona.com/en/festival/calendar/"}]}'::jsonb, '{"cityId":"barcelona","cityName":"Barcelona","weekLabel":"May 10-17, 2026","sourcedAt":"2026-05-10","timezone":"Europe/Madrid","refreshCadence":"weekly","sourceStrategy":["Start with official Barcelona agenda and venue calendars.","Add high-signal local editorial calendars for festivals, fairs, and ticketed cultural events.","Promote large multi-day city-shaping events into standalone guide candidates.","Refresh once weekly, then manually approve before publishing."],"events":[{"id":"barcelona-2026-05-docsbarcelona","cityId":"barcelona","cityName":"Barcelona","title":"DocsBarcelona Festival","category":"Signature","startsAt":"2026-05-07T10:00:00+02:00","endsAt":"2026-05-17T23:00:00+02:00","venue":"Multiple cinemas and cultural venues","neighborhood":"Citywide","description":"DocsBarcelona is the city''s documentary-film week, with screenings, talks, special sessions, filmmaker activity, and professional programming spread across Barcelona venues. Use it as a festival route: pick a day, choose one or two anchor screenings, then build the evening around the venue neighborhood.","highlights":["Opening film: A Fox Under a Pink Moon at Mooby Aribau.","Mark Cousins Docs d''Honor retrospective at Filmoteca.","Docs&City films connect Gaza, Barcelona, Tokyo, Granada, and other urban stories.","Music-li