p-simulators","title":"MotoGP simulators and fan zones","venue":"Placa de Catalunya","description":"The public fan-zone layer is the easiest way to feel the race weekend without leaving central Barcelona: simulators, replica bikes, games, food areas, and sponsor activations.","coordinates":[41.3869,2.1701],"url":"https://www.motogp.com"},{"id":"motogp-rider-appearances","title":"Rider appearances","venue":"Placa de Catalunya","description":"Rider appearances are the main reason to time the visit instead of wandering through casually. Expect the biggest crowds around names like Marc Marquez, Alex Marquez, Alex Rins, and Pedro Acosta if confirmed windows hold.","coordinates":[41.3869,2.1701],"url":"https://www.motogp.com"}]}'::jsonb, '{"cityId":"barcelona","cityName":"Barcelona","weekLabel":"May 10-17, 2026","sourcedAt":"2026-05-10","timezone":"Europe/Madrid","refreshCadence":"weekly","sourceStrategy":["Start with official Barcelona agenda and venue calendars.","Add high-signal local editorial calendars for festivals, fairs, and ticketed cultural events.","Promote large multi-day city-shaping events into standalone guide candidates.","Refresh once weekly, then manually approve before publishing."],"events":[{"id":"barcelona-2026-05-docsbarcelona","cityId":"barcelona","cityName":"Barcelona","title":"DocsBarcelona Festival","category":"Signature","startsAt":"2026-05-07T10:00:00+02:00","endsAt":"2026-05-17T23:00:00+02:00","venue":"Multiple cinemas and cultural venues","neighborhood":"Citywide","description":"DocsBarcelona is the city''s documentary-film week, with screenings, talks, special sessions, filmmaker activity, and professional programming spread across Barcelona venues. Use it as a festival route: pick a day, choose one or two anchor screenings, then build the evening around the venue neighborhood.","highlights":["Opening film: A Fox Under a Pink Moon at Mooby Aribau.","Mark Cousins Docs d''Honor retrospective at Filmoteca.","Docs&City films connect Gaza, Barcelona, Tokyo, Granada, and other urban stories.","Music-linked sessions at Casa Montjuic pair screenings with live performances.","Closing night: Teatres de Campanya at CCCB Hall."],"url":"https://docsbarcelona.com/en/festival/calendar/","sourceName":"DocsBarcelona official schedule / El Pais","coordinates":[41.3851,2.1734],"price":"Varies","isGuideWorthy":true,"guideReason":"Multi-day, multi-venue festival with enough programming depth for a dedicated guide.","activations":[{"id":"docsbarcelona-2026-05-07-2000-a-fox-under-a-pink-moon-1","title":"A Fox Under a Pink Moon","venue":"Mooby Aribau | Sala 5","startsAt":"2026-05-07T20:00:00+02:00","description":"Opening-film thread about Soraya, a sixteen-year-old Afghan artist documenting her attempts to escape Iran and reunite with her mother in Austria.","coordinates":[41.3867,2.1635],"url":"https://docsbarcelona.com/en/festival/calendar/"},{"id":"docsbarcelona-2026-05-08-1800-the-story-of-documentary-film-2","title":"The Story of Documentary Film","venue":"Filmoteca | Sala Chomon","startsAt":"2026-05-08T18:00:00+02:00","description":"Mark Cousins presents documentary cinema as a way to understand the last 120 years, from revolution and work to feminism, bodies, music, and fascism.","coordinates":[41.3784,2.1713],"url":"https://docsbarcelona.com/en/festival/calendar/"},{"id":"docsbarcelona-2026-05-08-1830-cobijo-3","title":"Cobijo","venue":"Renoir | Sala 6","startsAt":"2026-05-08T18:30:00+02:00","description":"A queer migration story following four people who fled toward the United States and rebuilt a fragile idea of home in Guatemala after harsh border policies blocked their plans.","coordinates":[41.3803,2.1609],"url":"https://docsbarcelona.com/en/festival/calendar/"},{"id":"docsbarcelona-2026-05-08-1900-bestia-4","title":"Bestia","venue":"Renoir | Sala 5","startsAt":"2026-05-08T19:00:00+02:00","description":"A portrait of three hunters in inland Catalonia that observes rural masculinity, contradiction, and the gap between traditional and urban mentalities.","coordinates":[41.3803,2.1609],"url":"https://docsbarcelona.com/en/festival/calendar/"},{"id":"docsbarcelona-2026-05-08-2000-las-casas-en-mi-5","title":"Las casas en mi","venue":"Casa Montjuic","startsAt":"2026-05-08T20:00:00+02:00","description":"Leon Guallart turns a tour of iconic twentieth-century architecture into a self-produced musical diary, paired in the festival with a live music performance.","coordinates":[41.3717,2.1589],"url":"https://docsbarcelona.com/en/festival/calendar/"},{"id":"docsbarcelona-2026-05-08-2045-80-angry-journalists-6","title":"80 Angry Journalists","venue":"Renoir | Sala 6","startsAt":"2026-05-08T20:45:00+02:00","description":"A contemporary journalism story in the festival line of films that look beyond headlines and put human stakes behind public conflict.","coordinates":[41.3803,2.1609],"url":"https://docsbarcelona.com/en/festival/calendar/"},{"id":"docsbarcelona-2026-05-08-2100-replica-7","title":"Replica","venue":"Renoir | Sala 5","startsAt":"2026-05-08T21:00:00+02:00","description":"A technology-and-intimacy documentary about three women in contemporary China who turn to AI lovers and test the boundary between emotional freedom and dependence.","coordinates":[41.3803,2.1609],"url":"https://docsbarcelona.com/en/festival/calendar/"},{"id":"docsbarcelona-2026-05-08-2100-les-culpables-8","title":"Les Culpables","venue":"CCCB Teatre","startsAt":"2026-05-08T21:00:00+02:00","description":"Marta Duran Lozano turns anonymous abortion testimonies into a collective screen space, using personal memory and staged voices to make silence visible.","coordinates":[41.383,2.1662],"url":"https://docsbarcelona.com/en/festival/calendar/"},{"id":"docsbarcelona-2026-05-09-1800-abandonados-9","title":"Abandonados","venue":"Mooby Aribau | Sala 5","startsAt":"2026-05-09T18:00:00+02:00","description":"Official calendar screening in the DocsBarcelona program.","coordinates":[41.3867,2.1635],"url":"https://docsbarcelona.com/en/festival/calendar/"},{"id":"docsbarcelona-2026-05-09-1830-whispers-in-the-woods-10","title":"Whispers in the Woods","venue":"Renoir | Sala 5","startsAt":"2026-05-09T18:30:00+02:00","description":"Vincent Munier follows forest sounds, wildlife, and family inheritance in a nature documentary built around listening as much as looking.","coordinates":[41.3803,2.1609],"url":"https://docsbarcelona.com/en/festival/calendar/"},{"id":"docsbarcelona-2026-05-09-1845-little-sinner-11","title":"Little Sinner","venue":"Renoir | Sala 6","startsAt":"2026-05-09T18:45:00+02:00","description":"A raw personal-recording journey from Damascus to Denmark, forced marriage, war, refugee crisis, and confrontation with the past.","coordinates":[41.3803,2.1609],"url":"https://docsbarcelona.com/en/festival/calendar/"},{"id":"docsbarcelona-2026-05-09-1845-plato-3-12","title":"Plato 3","venue":"CCCB Teatre","startsAt":"2026-05-09T18:45:00+02:00","description":"Maria Borrell returns to a closed rural Lleida pub through young people rehearsing a play about nights that still carry old shadows.","coordinates":[41.383,2.1662],"url":"https://docsbarcelona.com/en/festival/calendar/"},{"id":"docsbarcelona-2026-05-09-1900-afterlives-13","title":"Afterlives","venue":"Zumzeig","startsAt":"2026-05-09T19:00:00+02:00","description":"Official calendar screening in the DocsBarcelona program.","coordinates":[41.3756,2.1446],"url":"https://docsbarcelona.com/en/festival/calendar/"},{"id":"docsbarcelona-2026-05-09-2000-a-story-of-children-and-film-14","title":"A Story of Children and Film","venue":"Filmoteca | Sala Chomon","startsAt":"2026-05-09T20:00:00+02:00","description":"Part of the Mark Cousins retrospective, this film explores childhood across global cinema through 53 films from 25 countries.","coordinates":[41.3784,2.1713],"url":"https://docsbarcelona.com/en/festival/calendar/"},{"id":"docsbarcelona-2026-05-09-2045-the-beauty-of-errors-15","title":"The Beauty Of Errors","venue":"Renoir | Sala 6","startsAt":"2026-05-09T20:45:00+02:00","description":"A father-and-son portrait about intimacy, separation, loneliness, and the fear of losing love.","coordinates":[41.3803,2.1609],"url":"https://docsbarcelona.com/en/festival/calendar/"},{"id":"docsbarcelona-2026-05-09-2100-la-pieta-16","title":"La Pieta","venue":"CCCB Teatre","startsAt":"2026-05-09T21:00:00+02:00","description":"A glacier requiem linking family isolation, Icelandic landscape, photography, and ecological loss.","coordinates":[41.383,2.1662],"url":"https://docsbarcelona.com/en/festival/calendar/"},{"id":"docsbarcelona-2026-05-09-2100-a-fox-under-a-pink-moon-17","title":"A Fox Under a Pink Moon","venue":"Renoir | Sala 5","startsAt":"2026-05-09T21:00:00+02:00","description":"Opening-film thread about Soraya, a sixteen-year-old Afghan artist documenting her attempts to escape Iran and reunite with her mother in Austria.","coordinates":[41.3803,2.1609],"url":"https://docsbarcelona.com/en/festival/calendar/"},{"id":"docsbarcelona-2026-05-09-2115-guia-paranormal-de-la-costa-brava-18","title":"Guia paranormal de la Costa Brava","venue":"CCCB Auditori","startsAt":"2026-05-09T21:15:00+02:00","description":"Writer Mariana Enriquez travels the Costa Brava looking for ghost stories, myths, superstition, fear, and the unknown.","coordinates":[41.383,2.1662],"url":"https://docsbarcelona.com/en/festival/calendar/"},{"id":"docsbarcelona-2026-05-10-1745-barbara-forever-19","title":"Barbara Forever","venue":"Renoir | Sala 5","startsAt":"2026-05-10T17:45:00+02:00","description":"An expansive portrait of filmmaker Barbara Hammer, her sensual experimental cinema, lesbian cultural impact, archives, and voice.","coordinates":[41.3803,2.1609],"url":"https://docsbarcelona.com/en/festival/calendar/"},{"id":"docsbarcelona-2026-05-10-1800-i-am-belfast-20","title":"I Am Belfast","venue":"Filmoteca | Sala Chomon","startsAt":"2026-05-10T18:00:00+02:00","description":"Part of the Mark Cousins Docs d Honor retrospective, a poetic portrait of Belfast, its people, architecture, landscape, and conflict memory.","coordinates":[41.3784,2.1713],"url":"https://docsbarcelona.com/en/festival/calendar/"},{"id":"docsbarcelona-2026-05-10-1800-la-pieta-21","title":"La Pieta","venue":"Renoir | Sala 6","startsAt":"2026-05-10T18:00:00+02:00","description":"A glacier requiem linking family isolation, Icelandic landscape, photography, and ecological loss.","coordinates":[41.3803,2.1609],"url":"https://docsbarcelona.com/en/festival/calendar/"},{"id":"docsbarcelona-2026-05-10-1830-accio-portabella-22","title":"Accio Portabella","venue":"Casa Montjuic","startsAt":"2026-05-10T18:30:00+02:00","description":"Official calendar screening in the DocsBarcelona program.","coordinates":[41.3717,2.1589],"url":"https://docsbarcelona.com/en/festival/calendar/"},{"id":"docsbarcelona-2026-05-10-1900-with-hasan-in-gaza-23","title":"With Hasan in Gaza","venue":"Zumzeig","startsAt":"2026-05-10T19:00:00+02:00","description":"Kamal Aljafari uses recovered 2001 video tapes to turn a search in Gaza into a reflection on memory, loss, place, and time.","coordinates":[41.3756,2.1446],"url":"https://docsbarcelona.com/en/festival/calendar/"},{"id":"docsbarcelona-2026-05-10-2000-herencia-24","title":"Herencia","venue":"Renoir | Sala 6","startsAt":"2026-05-10T20:00:00+02:00","description":"A discovery of buried bodies on family land opens a journey through private memory, Spanish Civil War repression, intolerance, and conflict.","coordinates":[41.3803,2.1609],"url":"https://docsbarcelona.com/en/festival/calendar/"},{"id":"docsbarcelona-2026-05-10-2015-amazomania-25","title":"Amazomania","venue":"Renoir | Sala 5","startsAt":"2026-05-10T20:15:00+02:00","description":"Nathan Grossman revisits 1996 footage of the isolated Korubo people, reframing expedition imagery through colonial legacy and territorial conflict.","coordinates":[41.3803,2.1609],"url":"https://docsbarcelona.com/en/festival/calendar/"},{"id":"docsbarcelona-2026-05-10-2100-the-mar