-shaping events into standalone guide candidates.","Refresh once weekly, then manually approve before publishing."],"events":[{"id":"barcelona-2026-05-docsbarcelona","cityId":"barcelona","cityName":"Barcelona","title":"DocsBarcelona Festival","category":"Signature","startsAt":"2026-05-07T10:00:00+02:00","endsAt":"2026-05-17T23:00:00+02:00","venue":"Multiple cinemas and cultural venues","neighborhood":"Citywide","description":"DocsBarcelona is the city''s documentary-film week, with screenings, talks, special sessions, filmmaker activity, and professional programming spread across Barcelona venues. Use it as a festival route: pick a day, choose one or two anchor screenings, then build the evening around the venue neighborhood.","highlights":["Opening film: A Fox Under a Pink Moon at Mooby Aribau.","Mark Cousins Docs d''Honor retrospective at Filmoteca.","Docs&City films connect Gaza, Barcelona, Tokyo, Granada, and other urban stories.","Music-linked sessions at Casa Montjuic pair screenings with live performances.","Closing night: Teatres de Campanya at CCCB Hall."],"url":"https://docsbarcelona.com/en/festival/calendar/","sourceName":"DocsBarcelona official schedule / El Pais","coordinates":[41.3851,2.1734],"price":"Varies","isGuideWorthy":true,"guideReason":"Multi-day, multi-venue festival with enough programming depth for a dedicated guide.","activations":[{"id":"docsbarcelona-2026-05-07-2000-a-fox-under-a-pink-moon-1","title":"A Fox Under a Pink Moon","venue":"Mooby Aribau | Sala 5","startsAt":"2026-05-07T20:00:00+02:00","description":"Opening-film thread about Soraya, a sixteen-year-old Afghan artist documenting her attempts to escape Iran and reunite with her mother in Austria.","coordinates":[41.3867,2.1635],"url":"https://docsbarcelona.com/en/festival/calendar/"},{"id":"docsbarcelona-2026-05-08-1800-the-story-of-documentary-film-2","title":"The Story of Documentary Film","venue":"Filmoteca | Sala Chomon","startsAt":"2026-05-08T18:00:00+02:00","description":"Mark Cousins presents documentary cinema as a way to understand the last 120 years, from revolution and work to feminism, bodies, music, and fascism.","coordinates":[41.3784,2.1713],"url":"https://docsbarcelona.com/en/festival/calendar/"},{"id":"docsbarcelona-2026-05-08-1830-cobijo-3","title":"Cobijo","venue":"Renoir | Sala 6","startsAt":"2026-05-08T18:30:00+02:00","description":"A queer migration story following four people who fled toward the United States and rebuilt a fragile idea of home in Guatemala after harsh border policies blocked their plans.","coordinates":[41.3803,2.1609],"url":"https://docsbarcelona.com/en/festival/calendar/"},{"id":"docsbarcelona-2026-05-08-1900-bestia-4","title":"Bestia","venue":"Renoir | Sala 5","startsAt":"2026-05-08T19:00:00+02:00","description":"A portrait of three hunters in inland Catalonia that observes rural masculinity, contradiction, and the gap between traditional and urban mentalities.","coordinates":[41.3803,2.1609],"url":"https://docsbarcelona.com/en/festival/calendar/"},{"id":"docsbarcelona-2026-05-08-2000-las-casas-en-mi-5","title":"Las casas en mi","venue":"Casa Montjuic","startsAt":"2026-05-08T20:00:00+02:00","description":"Leon Guallart turns a tour of iconic twentieth-century architecture into a self-produced musical diary, paired in the festival with a live music performance.","coordinates":[41.3717,2.1589],"url":"https://docsbarcelona.com/en/festival/calendar/"},{"id":"docsbarcelona-2026-05-08-2045-80-angry-journalists-6","title":"80 Angry Journalists","venue":"Renoir | Sala 6","startsAt":"2026-05-08T20:45:00+02:00","description":"A contemporary journalism story in the festival line of films that look beyond headlines and put human stakes behind public conflict.","coordinates":[41.3803,2.1609],"url":"https://docsbarcelona.com/en/festival/calendar/"},{"id":"docsbarcelona-2026-05-08-2100-replica-7","title":"Replica","venue":"Renoir | Sala 5","startsAt":"2026-05-08T21:00:00+02:00","description":"A technology-and-intimacy documentary about three women in contemporary China who turn to AI lovers and test the boundary between emotional freedom and dependence.","coordinates":[41.3803,2.1609],"url":"https://docsbarcelona.com/en/festival/calendar/"},{"id":"docsbarcelona-2026-05-08-2100-les-culpables-8","title":"Les Culpables","venue":"CCCB Teatre","startsAt":"2026-05-08T21:00:00+02:00","description":"Marta Duran Lozano turns anonymous abortion testimonies into a collective screen space, using personal memory and staged voices to make silence visible.","coordinates":[41.383,2.1662],"url":"https://docsbarcelona.com/en/festival/calendar/"},{"id":"docsbarcelona-2026-05-09-1800-abandonados-9","title":"Abandonados","venue":"Mooby Aribau | Sala 5","startsAt":"2026-05-09T18:00:00+02:00","description":"Official calendar screening in the DocsBarcelona program.","coordinates":[41.3867,2.1635],"url":"https://docsbarcelona.com/en/festival/calendar/"},{"id":"docsbarcelona-2026-05-09-1830-whispers-in-the-woods-10","title":"Whispers in the Woods","venue":"Renoir | Sala 5","startsAt":"2026-05-09T18:30:00+02:00","description":"Vincent Munier follows forest sounds, wildlife, and family inheritance in a nature documentary built around listening as much as looking.","coordinates":[41.3803,2.1609],"url":"https://docsbarcelona.com/en/festival/calendar/"},{"id":"docsbarcelona-2026-05-09-1845-little-sinner-11","title":"Little Sinner","venue":"Renoir | Sala 6","startsAt":"2026-05-09T18:45:00+02:00","description":"A raw personal-recording journey from Damascus to Denmark, forced marriage, war, refugee crisis, and confrontation with the past.","coordinates":[41.3803,2.1609],"url":"https://docsbarcelona.com/en/festival/calendar/"},{"id":"docsbarcelona-2026-05-09-1845-plato-3-12","title":"Plato 3","venue":"CCCB Teatre","startsAt":"2026-05-09T18:45:00+02:00","description":"Maria Borrell returns to a closed rural Lleida pub through young people rehearsing a play about nights that still carry old shadows.","coordina