ava","venue":"CCCB Auditori","startsAt":"2026-05-09T21:15:00+02:00","description":"Writer Mariana Enriquez travels the Costa Brava looking for ghost stories, myths, superstition, fear, and the unknown.","coordinates":[41.383,2.1662],"url":"https://docsbarcelona.com/en/festival/calendar/"},{"id":"docsbarcelona-2026-05-10-1745-barbara-forever-19","title":"Barbara Forever","venue":"Renoir | Sala 5","startsAt":"2026-05-10T17:45:00+02:00","description":"An expansive portrait of filmmaker Barbara Hammer, her sensual experimental cinema, lesbian cultural impact, archives, and voice.","coordinates":[41.3803,2.1609],"url":"https://docsbarcelona.com/en/festival/calendar/"},{"id":"docsbarcelona-2026-05-10-1800-i-am-belfast-20","title":"I Am Belfast","venue":"Filmoteca | Sala Chomon","startsAt":"2026-05-10T18:00:00+02:00","description":"Part of the Mark Cousins Docs d Honor retrospective, a poetic portrait of Belfast, its people, architecture, landscape, and conflict memory.","coordinates":[41.3784,2.1713],"url":"https://docsbarcelona.com/en/festival/calendar/"},{"id":"docsbarcelona-2026-05-10-1800-la-pieta-21","title":"La Pieta","venue":"Renoir | Sala 6","startsAt":"2026-05-10T18:00:00+02:00","description":"A glacier requiem linking family isolation, Icelandic landscape, photography, and ecological loss.","coordinates":[41.3803,2.1609],"url":"https://docsbarcelona.com/en/festival/calendar/"},{"id":"docsbarcelona-2026-05-10-1830-accio-portabella-22","title":"Accio Portabella","venue":"Casa Montjuic","startsAt":"2026-05-10T18:30:00+02:00","description":"Official calendar screening in the DocsBarcelona program.","coordinates":[41.3717,2.1589],"url":"https://docsbarcelona.com/en/festival/calendar/"},{"id":"docsbarcelona-2026-05-10-1900-with-hasan-in-gaza-23","title":"With Hasan in Gaza","venue":"Zumzeig","startsAt":"2026-05-10T19:00:00+02:00","description":"Kamal Aljafari uses recovered 2001 video tapes to turn a search in Gaza into a reflection on memory, loss, place, and time.",