a.com/en/festival/calendar/"},{"id":"docsbarcelona-2026-05-12-1830-with-hasan-in-gaza-dt-alk-35","title":"With Hasan in Gaza + DT alk","venue":"CCCB Auditori","startsAt":"2026-05-12T18:30:00+02:00","description":"The Gaza memory film screens with a post-screening talk in the official calendar.","coordinates":[41.383,2.1662],"url":"https://docsbarcelona.com/en/festival/calendar/"},{"id":"docsbarcelona-2026-05-12-1845-atlas-de-la-desaparicion-36","title":"Atlas de la desaparicion","venue":"Renoir | Sala 5","startsAt":"2026-05-12T18:45:00+02:00","description":"Official calendar screening in the DocsBarcelona program.","coordinates":[41.3803,2.1609],"url":"https://docsbarcelona.com/en/festival/calendar/"},{"id":"docsbarcelona-2026-05-12-1900-the-hidden-face-of-the-earth-37","title":"The Hidden Face of the Earth","venue":"Renoir | Sala 6","startsAt":"2026-05-12T19:00:00+02:00","description":"Arnaud Alain follows a photographer losing his sight through encounters and memory in Paris and New York.","coordinates":[41.3803,2.1609],"url":"https://docsbarcelona.com/en/festival/calendar/"},{"id":"docsbarcelona-2026-05-12-1900-numakage-public-pool-38","title":"Numakage Public Pool","venue":"Casa Montjuic","startsAt":"2026-05-12T19:00:00+02:00","description":"Shingo Ota looks at a Tokyo public pool as a civic place for elders, families, and gay cruising communities before demolition.","coordinates":[41.3717,2.1589],"url":"https://docsbarcelona.com/en/festival/calendar/"},{"id":"docsbarcelona-2026-05-12-2000-the-history-of-concrete-39","title":"The History of Concrete","venue":"Mooby Aribau | Sala 5","startsAt":"2026-05-12T20:00:00+02:00","description":"John Wilson turns concrete, New York, and documentary filmmaking into a comic urban essay about built space and cinema.","coordinates":[41.3867,2.1635],"url":"https://docsbarcelona.com/en/festival/calendar/"},{"id":"docsbarcelona-2026-05-12-2000-bestia-40","title":"Bestia","venue":"Cinemes Texas | Sala 2","startsAt":"2026-05-12T20: