understand the last 120 years, from revolution and work to feminism, bodies, music, and fascism.","coordinates":[41.3784,2.1713],"url":"https://docsbarcelona.com/en/festival/calendar/"},{"id":"docsbarcelona-2026-05-08-1830-cobijo-3","title":"Cobijo","venue":"Renoir | Sala 6","startsAt":"2026-05-08T18:30:00+02:00","description":"A queer migration story following four people who fled toward the United States and rebuilt a fragile idea of home in Guatemala after harsh border policies blocked their plans.","coordinates":[41.3803,2.1609],"url":"https://docsbarcelona.com/en/festival/calendar/"},{"id":"docsbarcelona-2026-05-08-1900-bestia-4","title":"Bestia","venue":"Renoir | Sala 5","startsAt":"2026-05-08T19:00:00+02:00","description":"A portrait of three hunters in inland Catalonia that observes rural masculinity, contradiction, and the gap between traditional and urban mentalities.","coordinates":[41.3803,2.1609],"url":"https://docsbarcelona.com/en/festival/calendar/"},{"id":"docsbarcelona-2026-05-08-2000-las-casas-en-mi-5","title":"Las casas en mi","venue":"Casa Montjuic","startsAt":"2026-05-08T20:00:00+02:00","description":"Leon Guallart turns a tour of iconic twentieth-century architecture into a self-produced musical diary, paired in the festival with a live music performance.","coordinates":[41.3717,2.1589],"url":"https://docsbarcelona.com/en/festival/calendar/"},{"id":"docsbarcelona-2026-05-08-2045-80-angry-journalists-6","title":"80 Angry Journalists","venue":"Renoir | Sala 6","startsAt":"2026-05-08T20:45:00+02:00","description":"A contemporary journalism story in the festival line of films that look beyond headlines and put human stakes behind public conflict.","coordinates":[41.3803,2.1609],"url":"https://docsbarcelona.com/en/festival/calendar/"},{"id":"docsbarcelona-2026-05-08-2100-replica-7","title":"Replica","venue":"Renoir | Sala 5","startsAt":"2026-05-08T21:00:00+02:00","description":"A technology-and-intimacy documentary about three women in contemporary China who turn to AI lovers and test the boundary between emotional freedom and dependence.","coordinates":[41.3803,2.1609],"url":"https://docsbarcelona.com/en/festival/calendar/"},{"id":"docsbarcelona-2026-05-08-2100-les-culpables-8","title":"Les Culpables","venue":"CCCB Teatre","startsAt":"2026-05-08T21:00:00+02:00","description":"Marta Duran Lozano turns anonymous abortion testimonies into a collective screen space, using personal memory and staged voices to make silence visible.","coordinates":[41.383,2.1662],"url":"https://docsbarcelona.com/en/festival/calendar/"},{"id":"docsbarcelona-2026-05-09-1800-abandonados-9","title":"Abandonados","venue":"Mooby Aribau | Sala 5","startsAt":"2026-05-09T18:00:00+02:00","description":"Official calendar screening in the DocsBarcelona program.","coordinates":[41.3867,2.1635],"url":"https://docsbarcelona.com/en/festival/calendar/"},{"id":"docsbarcelona-2026-05-09-1830-whispers-in-the-woods-10","title":"Whispers in the Woods","venue":"Renoir | Sala 5","startsAt":"2026-05-09T18:30:00+02:00","description":"Vincent Munier follows forest sounds, wildlife, and family inheritance in a nature documentary built around listening as much as looking.","coordinates":[41.3803,2.1609],"url":"https://docsbarcelona.com/en/festival/calendar/"},{"id":"docsbarcelona-2026-05-09-1845-little-sinner-11","title":"Little Sinner","venue":"Renoir | Sala 6","startsAt":"2026-05-09T18:45:00+02:00","description":"A raw personal-recording journey from Damascus to Denmark, forced marriage, war, refugee crisis, and confrontation with the past.","coordinates":[41.3803,2.1609],"url":"https://docsbarcelona.com/en/festival/calendar/"},{"id":"docsbarcelona-2026-05-09-1845-plato-3-12","title":"Plato 3","venue":"CCCB Teatre","startsAt":"2026-05-09T18:45:00+02:00","description":"Maria Borrell returns to a closed rural Lleida pub through young people rehearsing a play about nights that still carry old shadows.","coordinates":[41.383,2.1662],"url":"https://docsbarcelona.com/en/festival/calendar/"},{"id":"docsbarcelona-2026-05-09-1900-afterlives-13","title":"Afterlives","venue":"Zumzeig","startsAt":"2026-05-09T19:00:00+02:00","description":"Official calendar screening in the DocsBarcelona program.","coordinates":[41.3756,2.1446],"url":"https://docsbarcelona.com/en/festival/calendar/"},{"id":"docsbarcelona-2026-05-09-2000-a-story-of-children-and-film-14","title":"A Story of Children and Film","venue":"Filmoteca | Sala Chomon","startsAt":"2026-05-09T20:00:00+02:00","description":"Part of the Mark Cousins retrospective, this film explores childhood across global cinema through 53 films from 25 countries.","coordinates":[41.3784,2.1713],"url":"https://docsbarcelona.com/en/festival/calendar/"},{"id":"docsbarcelona-2026-05-09-2045-the-beauty-of-errors-15","title":"The Beauty Of Errors","venue":"Renoir | Sala 6","startsAt":"2026-05-09T20:45:00+02:00","description":"A father-and-son portrait about intimacy, separation, loneliness, and the fear of losing love.","coordinates":[41.3803,2.1609],"url":"https://docsbarcelona.com/en/festival/calendar/"},{"id":"docsbarcelona-2026-05-09-2100-la-pieta-16","title":"La Pieta","venue":"CCCB Teatre","startsAt":"2026-05-09T21:00:00+02:00","description":"A glacier requiem linking family isolation, Icelandic landscape, photography, and ecological loss.","coordinates":[41.383,2.1662],"url":"https://docsbarcelona.com/en/festival/calendar/"},{"id":"docsbarcelona-2026-05-09-2100-a-fox-under-a-pink-moon-17","title":"A Fox Under a Pink Moon","venue":"Renoir | Sala 5","startsAt":"2026-05-09T21:00:00+02:00","description":"Opening-film thread about Soraya, a sixteen-year-old Afghan artist documenting her attempts to escape Iran and reunite with her mother in Austria.","coordinates":[41.3803,2.1609],"url":"https://docsbarcelona.com/en/festival/calendar/"},{"id":"docsbarcelona-2026-05-09-2115-guia-paranormal-de-la-costa-brava-18","title":"Guia paranormal de la Costa Brava","venue":"CCCB Auditori","startsAt":"2026-05-09T21:15:00+02:00","description":"Writer Mariana Enriquez travels the Costa Brava looking for ghost stories, myths, superstition, fear, and the unknown.","coordinates":[41.383,2.1662],"url":"https://docsbarcelona.com/en/festival/calendar/"},{"id":"docsbarcelona-2026-05-10-1745-barbara-forever-19","title":"Barbara Forever","venue":"Renoir | Sala 5","startsAt":"2026-05-10T17:45:00+02:00","description":"An expansive portrait of filmmaker Barbara Hammer, her sensual experimental cinema, lesbian cultural impact, archives, and voice.","coordinates":[41.3803,2.1609],"url":"https://docsbarcelona.com/en/festival/calendar/"},{"id":"docsbarcelona-2026-05-10-1800-i-am-belfast-20","title":"I Am Belfast","venue":"Filmoteca | Sala Chomon","startsAt":"2026-05-10T18:00:00+02:00","description":"Part of the Mark Cousins Docs d Honor retrospective, a poetic portrait of Belfast, its people, architecture, landscape, and conflict memory.","coordinates":[41.3784,2.1713],"url":"https://docsbarcelona.com/en/festival/calendar/"},{"id":"docsbarcelona-2026-05-10-1800-la-pieta-21","title":"La Pieta","venue":"Renoir | Sala 6","startsAt":"2026-05-10T18:00:00+02:00","description":"A glacier requiem linking family isolation, Icelandic landscape, photography, and ecological loss.","coordinates":[41.3803,2.1609],"url":"https://docsbarcelona.com/en/festival/calendar/"},{"id":"docsbarcelona-2026-05-10-1830-accio-portabella-22","title":"Accio Portabella","venue":"Casa Montjuic","startsAt":"2026-05-10T18:30:00+02:00","description":"Official calendar screening in the DocsBarcelona program.","coordinates":[41.3717,2.1589],"url":"https://docsbarcelona.com/en/festival/calendar/"},{"id":"docsbarcelona-2026-05-10-1900-with-hasan-in-gaza-23","title":"With Hasan in Gaza","venue":"Zumzeig","startsAt":"2026-05-10T19:00:00+02:00","description":"Kamal Aljafari uses recovered 2001 video tapes to turn a search in Gaza into a reflection on memory, loss, place, and time.","coordinates":[41.3756,2.1446],"url":"https://docsbarcelona.com/en/festival/calendar/"},{"id":"docsbarcelona-2026-05-10-2000-herencia-24","title":"Herencia","venue":"Renoir | Sala 6","startsAt":"2026-05-10T20:00:00+02:00","description":"A discovery of buried bodies on family land opens a journey through private memory, Spanish Civil War repression, intolerance, and conflict.","coordinates":[41.3803,2.1609],"url":"https://docsbarcelona.com/en/festival/calendar/"},{"id":"docsbarcelona-2026-05-10-2015-amazomania-25","title":"Amazomania","venue":"Renoir | Sala 5","startsAt":"2026-05-10T20:15:00+02:00","description":"Nathan Grossman revisits 1996 footage of the isolated Korubo people, reframing expedition imagery through colonial legacy and territorial conflict.","coordinates":[41.3803,2.1609],"url":"https://docsbarcelona.com/en/festival/calendar/"},{"id":"docsbarcelona-2026-05-10-2100-the-march-on-rome-26","title":"The March on Rome","venue":"Filmoteca | Sala Chomon","startsAt":"2026-05-10T21:00:00+02:00","description":"Mark Cousins uses archive and essay-film analysis to examine Italian fascism, visual propaganda, and the political present.","coordinates":[41.3784,2.1713],"url":"https://docsbarcelona.com/en/festival/calendar/"},{"id":"docsbarcelona-2026-05-11-1830-barbara-forever-27","title":"Barbara Forever","venue":"Renoir | Sala 6","startsAt":"2026-05-11T18:30:00+02:00","description":"An expansive portrait of filmmaker Barbara Hammer, her sensual experimental cinema, lesbian cultural impact, archives, and voice.","coordinates":[41.3803,2.1609],"url":"https://docsbarcelona.com/en/festival/calendar/"},{"id":"docsbarcelona-2026-05-11-1845-indomita-llum-28","title":"Indomita llum","venue":"Renoir | Sala 5","startsAt":"2026-05-11T18:45:00+02:00","description":"A Catalan-Argentine documentary about Antu, a blind nine-year-old traveling through Argentina with parents who project films in small towns.","coordinates":[41.3803,2.1609],"url":"https://docsbarcelona.com/en/festival/calendar/"},{"id":"docsbarcelona-2026-05-11-1845-das-deutsche-volk-29","title":"Das Deutsche Volk","venue":"Zumzeig","startsAt":"2026-05-11T18:45:00+02:00","description":"Official calendar screening in the DocsBarcelona program.","coordinates":[41.3756,2.1446],"url":"https://docsbarcelona.com/en/festival/calendar/"},{"id":"docsbarcelona-2026-05-11-1900-la-conversa-infinita-30","title":"La conversa infinita","venue":"Phenomena","startsAt":"2026-05-11T19:00:00+02:00","description":"Official calendar screening in the DocsBarcelona program.","coordinates":[41.4098,2.1703],"url":"https://docsbarcelona.com/en/festival/calendar/"},{"id":"docsbarcelona-2026-05-11-1930-curtmetratges-singular-i-plural-31","title":"Curtmetratges: Singular i plural","venue":"CCCB Auditori","startsAt":"2026-05-11T19:30:00+02:00","description":"A short-film program from the official DocsBarcelona calendar.","coordinates":[41.383,2.1662],"url":"https://docsbarcelona.com/en/festival/calendar/"},{"id":"docsbarcelona-2026-05-11-2000-replica-gavina-mp3-32","title":"Replica + gavina.mp3","venue":"Casa Montjuic","startsAt":"2026-05-11T20:00:00+02:00","description":"Replica pairs its AI-intimacy story with a gavina.mp3 performance at Casa Montjuic.","coordinates":[41.3717,2.1589],"url":"https://docsbarcelona.com/en/festival/calendar/"},{"id":"docsbarcelona-2026-05-11-2030-cuba-alaska-dt-alk-33","title":"Cuba & Alaska + DT alk","venue":"Renoir | Sala 6","startsAt":"2026-05-11T20:30:00+02:00","description":"A frontline Ukraine documentary about two medic friends, paired with a post-screening talk in the official calendar.","coordinates":[41.3803,2.1609],"url":"https://docsbarcelona.com/en/festival/calendar/"},{"id":"docsbarcelona-2026-05-11-2045-atlas-de-la-desaparicion-34","title":"Atlas de la desaparicion","venue":"Renoir | Sala 5","startsAt":"2026-05-11T20:45:00+02:00","description":"Official calendar screening in the DocsBarcelona program.","coordinates":[41.3803,2.1609],"url":"https://docsbarcelona.com/en/festival/calendar/"},{"id":"docsbarcelona-2026-05-12-1830-with-hasan-in-gaza-dt-alk-35","title":"With Hasan in Gaza + DT alk","venue":"CCCB Auditori","startsAt":"2026-05-12T18:30:00+02:00","description":"The Gaza memory film screens with a post-screening talk in the official calendar.","coordinates":[41.383,2.1662],"url":"https://docsbarcelona.com/en/festival/calendar/"},{"id":"docsbarcelona-2026-05-12-1845-atlas-de-la-desaparicion-36","title":"Atlas de la desaparicion","venue":"Renoir | Sala 5","startsAt":"2026-05-12T18:45:00+02:00","description":"Official calendar screening in the DocsBarcelona program.","coordinates":[41.3803,2.1609],"url":"https://docsbarcelona.com/en/festival/calendar/"},{"id":"docsbarcelona-2026-05-12-1900-the-hidden-face-of-the-earth-37","title":"The Hidden Face of the Earth","venue":"Renoir | Sala 6","startsAt":"2026-05-12T19:00:00+02:00","description":"Arnaud Alain follows a photographer losing his sight through encounters and memory in Paris and New York.","coordinates":[41.3803,2.1609],"url":"https://docsbarcelona.com/en/festival/calendar/"},{"id":"docsbarcelona-2026-05-12-1900-numakage-public-pool-38","title":"Numakage Public Pool","venue":"Casa Montjuic","startsAt":"2026-05-12T19:00:00+02:00","description":"Shingo Ota looks at a Tokyo public pool as a civic place for elders, families, and gay cruising communities before demolition.","coordinates":[41.3717,2.1589],"url":"https://docsbarcelona.com/en/festival/calendar/"},{"id":"docsbarcelona-2026-05-12-2000-the-history-of-concrete-39","title":"The History of Concrete","venue":"Mooby Aribau | Sala 5","startsAt":"2026-05-12T20:00:00+02:00","description":"John Wilson turns concrete, New York, and documentary filmmaking into a comic urban essay about built space and cinema.","coordinates":[41.3867,2.1635],"url":"https://docsbarcelona.com/en/festival/calendar/"},{"id":"docsbarcelona-2026-05-12-2000-bestia-40","title":"Bestia","venue":"Cinemes Texas | Sala 2","startsAt":"2026-05-12T20:00:00+02:00","description":"A portrait of three hunters in inland Catalonia that observes rural masculinity, contradiction, and the gap between traditional and urban mentalities.","coordinates":[41.4024,2.1586],"url":"https://docsbarcelona.com/en/festival/calendar/"},{"id":"docsbarcelona-2026-05-12-2030-the-woman-who-poked-the-leopard-41","title":"The Woman Who Poked the Leopard","venue":"Renoir | Sala 6","startsAt":"2026-05-12T20:30:00+02:00","description":"Official calendar screening in the DocsBarcelona program.","coordinates":[41.3803,2.1609],"url":"https://docsbarcelona.com/en/festival/calendar/"},{"id":"docsbarcelona-2026-05-12-2100-quien-vio-los-templos-caer-42","title":"Quien vio los templos caer","venue":"Renoir | Sala 5","startsAt":"2026-05-12T21:00:00+02:00","description":"Lucia Selva follows Chorrojumo and Anas through Granada ruins, ancestry, limbo, and a city in transformation.","coordinates":[41.3803,2.1609],"url":"https://docsbarcelona.com/en/festival/calendar/"},{"id":"docsbarcelona-2026-05-13-1830-indomita-llum-43","title":"Indomita llum","venue":"Cinemes Texas | Sala 2","startsAt":"2026-05-13T18:30:00+02:00","description":"A Catalan-Argentine documentary about Antu, a blind nine-year-old traveling through Argentina with parents who project films in small towns.","coordinates":[41.4024,2.1586],"url":"https://docsbarcelona.com/en/festival/calendar/"},{"id":"docsbarcelona-2026-05-13-1830-les-culpables-44","title":"Les Culpables","venue":"Renoir | Sala 5","startsAt":"2026-05-13T18:30:00+02:00","description":"Marta Duran Lozano turns anonymous abortion testimonies into a collective screen space, using personal memory and staged voices to make silence visible.","coordinates":[41.3803,2.1609],"url":"https://docsbarcelona.com/en/festival/calendar/"},{"id":"docsbarcelona-2026-05-13-1845-numakage-public-pool-45","title":"Numakage Public Pool","venue":"Renoir | Sala 6","startsAt":"2026-05-13T18:45:00+02:00","description":"Shingo Ota looks at a Tokyo public pool as a civic place for elders, families, and gay cruising communities before demolition.","coordinates":[41.3803,2.1609],"url":"https://docsbarcelona.com/en/festival/calendar/"},{"id":"docsbarcelona-2026-05-13-1900-quien-vio-los-templos-caer-dt-alk-46","title":"Quien vio los templos caer + DT alk","venue":"CCCB Auditori","startsAt":"2026-05-13T19:00:00+02:00","description":"The Granada city-transformation film screens with a post-screening talk in the official calendar.","coordinates":[41.383,2.1662],"url":"https://docsbarcelona.com/en/festival/calendar/"},{"id":"docsbarcelona-2026-05-13-2030-herencia-47","title":"Herencia","venue":"Cinemes Texas | Sala 2","startsAt":"2026-05-13T20:30:00+02:00","description":"A discovery of buried bodies on family land opens a journey through private memory, Spanish Civil War repression, intolerance, and conflict.","coordinates":[41.4024,2.1586],"url":"https://docsbarcelona.com/en/festival/calendar/"},{"id":"docsbarcelona-2026-05-13-2030-little-sinner-48","title":"Little Sinner","venue":"Renoir | Sala 6","startsAt":"2026-05-13T20:30:00+02:00","description":"A raw personal-recording journey from Damascus to Denmark, forced marriage, war, refugee crisis, and confrontation with the past.","coordinates":[41.3803,2.1609],"url":"https://docsbarcelona.com/en/festival/calendar/"},{"id":"docsbarcelona-2026-05-13-2045-como-todo-mortal-49","title":"Como todo mortal","venue":"Renoir | Sala 5","startsAt":"2026-05-13T20:45:00+02:00","description":"Official calendar screening in the DocsBarcelona program.","coordinates":[41.3803,2.1609],"url":"https://docsbarcelona.com/en/festival/calendar/"},{"id":"docsbarcelona-2026-05-14-1830-miss-jobson-50","title":"Miss Jobson","venue":"Renoir | Sala 5","startsAt":"2026-05-14T18:30:00+02:00","description":"Amanda Sans Pantling profiles Diane Jobson, Jamaican Rastafari icon, Bob Marley lawyer, and lifelong defender of the vulnerable.","coordinates":[41.3803,2.1609],"url":"https://docsbarcelona.com/en/festival/calendar/"},{"id":"docsbarcelona-2026-05-14-1845-the-woman-who-poked-the-leopard-51","title":"The Woman Who Poked the Leopard","venue":"Renoir | Sala 6","startsAt":"2026-05-14T18:45:00+02:00","description":"Official calendar screening in the DocsBarcelona program.","coordinates":[41.3803,2.1609],"url":"https://docsbarcelona.com/en/festival/calendar/"},{"id":"docsbarcelona-2026-05-14-1900-curtmetratges-cossos-en-crisi-52","title":"Curtmetratges: Cossos en crisi","venue":"CCCB Auditori","startsAt":"2026-05-14T19:00:00+02:00","description":"A short-film program from the official DocsBarcelona calendar focused on bodies in crisis.","coordinates":[41.383,2.1662],"url":"https://docsbarcelona.com/en/festival/calendar/"},{"id":"docsbarcelona-2026-05-14-2000-do-you-love-me-mar-pujol-53","title":"Do You Love Me + Mar Pujol","venue":"Casa Montjuic","startsAt":"2026-05-14T20:00:00+02:00","description":"Lana Daher’s Beirut archive film is paired with a live Mar Pujol concert, extending the screening into music and memory.","coordinates":[41.3717,2.1589],"url":"https://docsbarcelona.com/en/festival/calendar/"},{"id":"docsbarcelona-2026-05-14-2030-cobijo-54","title":"Cobijo","venue":"Cinemes Texas | Sala 1","startsAt":"2026-05-14T20:30:00+02:00","description":"A queer migration story following four people who fled toward the United States and rebuilt a fragile idea of home in Guatemala after harsh border policies blocked their plans.","coordinates":[41.4024,2.1586],"url":"https://docsbarcelona.com/en/festival/calendar/"},{"id":"docsbarcelona-2026-05-14-2045-mailin-55","title":"Mailin","venue":"Renoir | Sala 5","startsAt":"2026-05-14T20:45:00+02:00","description":"Maria Silvia Esteve follows a woman reconstructing memories of abuse by a priest while trying to offer her daughter the childhood she never had.","coordinates":[41.3803,2.1609],"url":"https://docsbarcelona.com/en/festival/calendar/"},{"id":"docsbarcelona-2026-05-14-2100-the-hidden-face-of-the-earth-56","title":"The Hidden Face of the Earth","venue":"Renoir | Sala 6","st